    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;、何を読んでるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What have you got there, &lt;Beryl&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10300</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっき軍がバラ撒いた
ボクたちの手配書だよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's our wanted poster the military's handing out...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ボクたちの指名手配書だよ
・ みんなは見ない方がいいよ……
・ ……読んであげよっか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's our wanted poster.
・You guys don't gotta see this...
・ Want me to read it out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見ない方がいいよ……
スピリアが傷つくから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You guys don't gotta see this... it may break their fragile little Spirias.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごくり……そんなに
ひどい内容なの!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my... is it really THAT bad?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>知らない方が
幸せな事って……あるよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well... I just think you'd be happier not knowing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……読んであげよっか？
確実にスピリアが傷つくけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Want me to read it out? You better brace your Spirias for this, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごくり……そんなに
ひどい内容なの!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my... is it really THAT bad?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リグナトル基地襲撃容疑で
以下の六名のソーマ使いを
Ｓ級指名手配とする</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The following six Somatics are S-class criminals wanted for the assault on Lignatore Garrison.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Shing&gt;＝メテオライト。
片手剣型ソーマ使い。
特徴：子どもっぽい顔と言動</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Shing&gt; Meteoryte. A single handed sword wielding Somatic. Characteristics: childish face and behaviour.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;＝ハーツ。
双弓型ソーマ使い。
ふてぶてしい態度。シスコン</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt; Hearts. A dual crossbow wielding Somatic. Has a brazen attitude. Obsessed with his sister.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>正体不明の鎧の男
腕型ソーマ使い。
特徴：無口、無表情、無愛想</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A male Somatic with an unidentified armor-like Soma. Characteristics: taciturn, expressionless and blunt.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、案外
フツーじゃねぇか？
……シスコンは余計だが</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I dunno, this all sounds pretty normal to me? “Obsessed” is goin' a bit far, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>問題はボクたちだよっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just wait 'till I get to us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;＝ローレンツ。
ついつい胸に目がいってしまい
所持ソーマは記憶になし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Ines&gt; Lorenz. Were too distracted by her figure to remember Soma type.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>特徴：圧倒的なバストと銀髪。
胸の大っきな美人。
備考：ゆれる。とにかくゆれる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Characteristics: an incredible rack and silver hair. A well-endowed beauty. Final remark: Jiggly. real jiggly.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何それ!?　胸の事しか
書いてないじゃない！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>EXCUSE ME?! Why was that entirely about my boobs?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;＝ハーツ
バトン型ソーマ使い。
特徴：可憐な美少女</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kohaku&gt; Hearts. A baton wielding Somatic. Characteristics: a pretty girl.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>備考：……と見せかけて
足クセ悪し。
かなり凶暴。要注意</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Remarks... couldn't help but stare at her legs. Though they seem rather vicious, so exercise caution.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……凶暴…………が〜ん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Vicious...? No...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Beryl&gt;＝ベニト。
ほうき型ソーマ使い。
特徴：変な帽子。推定年齢十才</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Beryl&gt; Benito. A broom wielding Somatic. Characteristics: weird hat. Estimated to be about ten years old.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>備考：一番捕まえやすそう。
発見したら集中して
攻撃すべし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Remarks: appears to be the easiest to catch. Target her first when spotted.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17376</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ〜〜ほうきじゃないし
変な帽子じゃないし
十歳でもなぁ〜〜〜いっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grrr FIRST OFF it is NOT a broom! And my hat is NOT weird, and I most CERTAINLY am NOT TEN~!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18808</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なるほど、手配書を
見た奴らは&lt;Beryl&gt;を
集中的に狙うのか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, so everyone who sees this poster's gonna go for her first...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、やばくなったら
&lt;Beryl&gt;をおとりにして
逃げんぞ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alrighty, if things get real dicey, we can toss her out as a decoy and skedaddle! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
